  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Asymptotics of the quantum invariants for surgeries on the figure-8 knot (Andersen–Hansen, JKTR) — asymptotic expansion of the SU(2) Reshetikhin–Turaev invariants for surgeries on 4₁.\n\n**Asymptotics of the quantum invariants for surgeries on the figure 8 knot** — Jørgen Ellegaard Andersen and Søren Kold Hansen. Journal of Knot Theory and Its Ramifications. arXiv:math/0506456v1 [math.QA], 22 Jun 2005.\n\nInvestigates the Reshetikhin–Turaev invariants associated to SU(2) for the 3-manifolds obtained by surgery on the figure-eight knot, and their asymptotic expansion.\n\n**Why it may bear here.** The figure-eight complement is the calibration object of this corpus (Vol(4₁) = 2·Cl₂(π/3) pins the CAL-2 modulus), and asymptotic expansions of its quantum invariants are the volume-conjecture side of that same knot. Adjacent to the Ohtsuki 5₂ asymptotics already held.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
